714
00:43:15,000 --> 00:43:20,000
It's there's a fee that we pay to essentially create the exam and mark it.

715
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:25,000
And then we need a little bit of to cover the costs for a proctor and things like that.

716
00:43:26,000 --> 00:43:28,000
So the fee, one hundred and fifty dollars per exam.

717
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:33,000
But when you compare that to what a course would cost, the difference is quite a bit.

718
00:43:33,000 --> 00:43:37,000
And a lot of these courses actually like biology, chemistry, psychology.

719
00:43:38,000 --> 00:43:39,000
