720
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:43,000
Those are all covering two university classes.

721
00:43:43,000 --> 00:43:49,000
So students get, I think, eight credit university credits for biology for just taking that

722
00:43:49,000 --> 00:43:53,000
one one exam, which is a pretty big advantage.

