737
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:10,000
So I think leading up to taking AP, if you're interested in that, do all of the things that, you know, would help you prepare.

738
00:45:10,000 --> 00:45:19,000
So taking enriched classes, getting good grades, going for help, you know, taking classes that are related to that subject area, I think would all be good, good things.

