765
00:46:51,000 --> 00:46:58,000
So we in our school, we have courses, career courses that are offered from grade 10 through to grade 12.

766
00:46:58,000 --> 00:47:03,000
The Career Life Education 10 course is taught typically in a classroom here.

767
00:47:03,000 --> 00:47:05,000
