813
00:50:46,000 --> 00:50:51,000
I volunteer with my community group, my soccer club, my faith organization.

814
00:50:51,000 --> 00:50:52,000
Could I use that towards my hours?

815
00:50:52,000 --> 00:50:53,000
For sure.

816
00:50:53,000 --> 00:50:56,000
We have paperwork that we provide the students with, so that counts.

817
00:50:56,000 --> 00:51:03,000
Most of our students here at Burme Mountain go on to complete an additional 50 hours of volunteering in the community for all the reasons we just stated.

818
00:51:03,000 --> 00:51:10,000
It's super beneficial for them and for their growth and really does give them things to write about as they were talking about those post-secondary applications.

819
00:51:10,000 --> 00:51:12,000
It really gives them experiences to draw on.

820
00:51:13,000 --> 00:51:17,000
So the students are all in teams where they can see all the different work experience opportunities.

