889
00:57:20,000 --> 00:57:25,000
And then we have what's called portfolio development programs, Industry Connect.

890
00:57:25,000 --> 00:57:29,000
These are all programs that help students develop a portfolio to get ready for post secondary.

891
00:57:30,000 --> 00:57:43,000
And then we have industry certification programs. Students get a certificate and then sometimes even credit a post secondary for some of the courses that they take in these in these programs.

892
00:57:43,000 --> 00:57:56,000
